    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>No-op node. The executor pauses the turn after this node exits, giving the client a chance to inspect/mutate agent state (via ChangeAgentParam) before the graph continues. Resume with ResumeAgentRequest. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
